ory":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"XkQadWW9bUR855KvPZBNUw","review_id":"Kr1mMv7XSOk7TP-k5lGeGg","date":"2013-04-09T01:42:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368175268173218,"text_excerpt":"Good stuff. We went for lunch because it is near my sister's office and offers outdoor seating, and we wanted to enjoy a cold beer and the nice weather with her only having a short amount of time to join us. The server was great, the beer was great, the food was very good, and the price was fine. My lobster and shrimp tacos were terrific, and the girls had burgers that looked fantastic. Didnt get to have apps or dessert, but I will next time we are in town. I am actually looking forward to telling my sis to meet me after work and holding up the bar, drinking good beer and hanging out until she can get there. Good solid spot. I am a fan."},{"business_id":"XkQadWW9bUR855KvPZBNUw","review_id":"sOYgHM54sITjdxZzjwwcZA","date":"2020-04-04T19:47:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9362020492553711,"text_excerpt":"Beer was pretty good. Food was good. Service was awesome. I like the dim lighting and decor - very nice layout of the restaurant. This would be a fun place to come watch the game or hangout with a big group. I wouldn't say the food was super memorable but it was good, basic bar food. I got the veggie burger which is truly a garden burger. Fries were yummy. Lots of beer options to choose from and other alcoholic beverages, too. A chill spot that's a good break from the craziness of New Orleans."},{"business_id":"XkQadWW9bUR855KvPZBNUw","review_id":"VZx94M2taVKifHbnibzeTg","date":"2018-09-06T23:01:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9336222410202026,"text_excerpt":"I had the chicken sandwich and it was delicious. I should have gotten the sweet potato fries instead of the regular fries. They were delicious either way. They also have decent calamari as well for a appetizer. I would highly suggest going since it wasn't crazy busy and was very fast. Our waiter was very nice and even got us to go drinks to stay hydrated as we adventured across New Orleans."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XkQadWW9bUR855KvPZBNUw","photo_id":"5r4lBq4dFzOnyM4xvCzz0g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5r4lBq4dFzOnyM4xvCzz0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8973272442817688},{"business_id":"XkQadWW9bUR855KvPZBNUw","photo_id":"y1hhQWbJzqts2hnEwo12XA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/y1hhQWbJzqts2hnEwo12XA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8710033893585205},{"business_id":"XkQadWW9bUR855KvPZBNUw","photo_id":"6Aksi6ZeUV3SSv5HNAtxgA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6Aksi6ZeUV3SSv5HNAtxgA.jpg",